<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mercantile Bankshares.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of Mercantile Bankshares Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said healthy margins, modest loan growth and fee income growth will help Mercantile grow its earnings at an annual compound rate of 8.5 percent over the next two years.</p>
<p>-- said Mercantile is attractive takeover candidate. Possible suitors could include Crestar Financial Corp, NationsBank Corp, Wachovia Corp or First Union Corp.</p>
<p>-- sets 1997 earnings estimates of $2.68 a share and a 1998 estimate of $2.88 a share.</p>
</text>
